'''Easter Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] grants a 15% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]], [[Freeze|freeze]], [[Slow|slow]], or [[Weaken|weaken]] [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies.

